A far better lujvo for mushroom, in most of its English uses, would be
food-fungus.  I think "mold" grates because it's a poor choice of keyword
relative to "fungus"; in Italian, e.g. edible mushrooms are simply
"funghi", and no further qualification is thought necessary.

